`conformance/queries.sql`, on PostgreSQL 18.7 (Ubuntu 18.7-1.pgdg24.04+5); not edited by hand. Each
instance is given as plain relations, and each answer, instance by instance,
as the list of the tuples PostgreSQL returned, in the order it returned
them, which the theorems read as a multiset. The instances are, in order:
`main`, `empty`, `nonull`, `dups`.
-/

